# Optional. The Dropbox client ids are built in and selected automatically by host,
# so this file is only needed to override them for a specific build.
#
# Set this when you want a build to use a specific Dropbox app regardless of where it
# is served. A key entered in the Sync panel takes precedence over this.
#
# This is an OAuth client id, which is public, not a password. The Dropbox app
# secret must never appear in any VITE_ variable — anything prefixed VITE_ is bundled
# into the shipped JavaScript.
#
# See docs/dropbox-app-setup.md
VITE_DROPBOX_APP_KEY=
